title trim page time ruler: the window starts at the take's start (marker 0:30, ZOOM 60 s): the first ruler label "0:00" begins at the window's left edge, inside the panel; every label and tick inside the frame, the label row under the waveform
sizes 480x480
ppmm 667
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_MARKER 30000

wait 600
shot ruler-start
expect text "ZOOM"
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
